# batched ignore decision coverage
bridge: project all workspace triggers in decision.triggerIds, group by conversationId, emit messageIds[] with deterministic key decision-ignored:<decisionId>:<conversationId>
dispatcher: closes only when every uncovered message is older than the newest covered message and no uncovered message has pending/delivering delivery
regression:
  - two covered messages -> not_accepted
  - covered batch + uncovered newer input -> stays pending; later event covering all three -> not_accepted
  - single message, receipt-lag, later pending, API/ignore order, alias tests remain
  - dispatcher integration 33/33
